The Old Masters

The Old Masters Box 1, The Old Masters Box 2 a The Old Masters Box 3 jsou box sety amerického rockového hudebníka Franka Zappy, postupně vydané v letech 1985, 1986 a 1987. První box set obsahuje alba "Freak Out!", "Absolutely Free", "We're Only in It for the Money", "Lumpy Gravy" a "Cruising with Ruben &amp; the Jets", druhý "Uncle Meat", "Hot Rats", "Burnt Weeny Sandwich", "Weasels Ripped My Flesh", "Chunga's Revenge", "Fillmore East - June 1971" a "Just Another Band from L.A." a třetí "Waka/Jawaka", "The Grand Wazoo", "Over-Nite Sensation", "Apostrophe (')", "Roxy &amp; Elsewhere", "One Size Fits All", "Bongo Fury" a "Zoot Allures".

